From 2f89e681569bb8ed2ac7df58d70806fbf3e60e0f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: z060142 <z060142@yahoo.com.tw>
Date: Wed, 26 Aug 2026 22:25:17 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 35/57] docs: front filter PSF texture is the bokeh-mask asset
 type (uncompressed 32-bit DDS in textures/lights/lens_flares); 4/6/8-point
 star DDS examples generated by tools/make_star_psf.py

---
 Code/CryPlugins/CinematicCamera/FilterPSFSpec.md              | 2 +-
 .../CinematicCamera/Module/CinematicCameraComponent.h         | 4 +++-
 Code/CryPlugins/CinematicCamera/README.md                     | 2 +-
 3 files changed, 5 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Code/CryPlugins/CinematicCamera/FilterPSFSpec.md b/Code/CryPlugins/CinematicCamera/FilterPSFSpec.md
index 9330ba19..d5825fee 100644
--- a/Code/CryPlugins/CinematicCamera/FilterPSFSpec.md
+++ b/Code/CryPlugins/CinematicCamera/FilterPSFSpec.md
@@ -92,7 +92,7 @@ New component group `SCineFilterParams` "Front Filter" (own GUID, new 4CCs):
 | `starSize` ('flSz') | Star Size | `Range<0, 1, 0, 1>` | 0.25 | Reach of the pattern, as a fraction of frame height. Brighter sources show more of it. |
 | `starRotation` ('flRt') | Star Rotation (deg) | `Range<0, 360, 0, 360>` | 0 | Turning the filter turns the star. |
 | `starThreshold` ('flTh') | Star Threshold | `Range<1, 64, 2, 16>` | 6 | Scene HDR luminance a source needs to spawn the pattern. |
-| `psfTexture` ('flTx') | PSF Texture | `Schematyc::TextureFileName` (keep LAST, `operator==` memcmp prefix like `SCineLensParams`) | empty | RGB point-spread image of the filter, centred, black outside the pattern. Empty = procedural star. |
+| `psfTexture` ('flTx') | PSF Texture | `Schematyc::TextureFileName` (keep LAST, `operator==` memcmp prefix like `SCineLensParams`) | empty | RGB point-spread image of the filter, centred, black outside the pattern. Asset type = the bokeh shape masks' (uncompressed 32-bit DDS, in `textures/lights/lens_flares/` with the projector-light textures; no resource-compiler round trip). Examples `filter_star4/6/8.dds`, generated by `tools/make_star_psf.py`. Empty = procedural star. |
 
 Component: apply / save / restore in the streaks apply function (`ApplyStreaks` or wherever
 `HDR_Streaks_AnamorphicAmount` is pushed), texture through `SetPostEffectParamString` like
diff --git a/Code/CryPlugins/CinematicCamera/Module/CinematicCameraComponent.h b/Code/CryPlugins/CinematicCamera/Module/CinematicCameraComponent.h
index 0d744d13..d5e6c7d6 100644
--- a/Code/CryPlugins/CinematicCamera/Module/CinematicCameraComponent.h
+++ b/Code/CryPlugins/CinematicCamera/Module/CinematicCameraComponent.h
@@ -612,7 +612,9 @@ struct SCineFilterParams
 			'flTx', "PSFTexture", "PSF Texture",
 			"RGB point-spread image of the filter: what one bright point looks like through it, "
 			"centred, black outside the pattern. Covers any front-element PSF a preset wants - "
-			"a dirty or smeared filter, a custom flare plate. Empty = procedural star.",
+			"a dirty or smeared filter, a custom flare plate. Same asset type as the bokeh shape "
+			"masks: an uncompressed 32-bit DDS, e.g. textures/lights/lens_flares/filter_star6.dds. "
+			"Empty = procedural star.",
 			Schematyc::TextureFileName());
 	}
 
diff --git a/Code/CryPlugins/CinematicCamera/README.md b/Code/CryPlugins/CinematicCamera/README.md
index 1506778c..8c7fb609 100644
--- a/Code/CryPlugins/CinematicCamera/README.md
+++ b/Code/CryPlugins/CinematicCamera/README.md
@@ -247,7 +247,7 @@ A plate screwed onto the **front** of the lens, in front of every other optic. S
 | Star Size | 0-1 | 0.25 | Reach of the pattern, as a fraction of the frame height. Brighter sources show more of it - the pattern is fixed, only its faint tail rises above the scene. |
 | Star Rotation (deg) | 0-360 | 0 | Turning the filter turns the star. |
 | Star Threshold | 1-64 (slider 2-16) | 6.0 | Scene HDR luminance a source needs to spawn the pattern. |
-| PSF Texture | texture | empty | RGB point-spread image of the filter: what one bright point looks like through it, centred, black outside the pattern. Covers any front-element PSF a preset wants - a dirty or smeared filter, a custom flare plate. Empty = procedural star. |
+| PSF Texture | texture | empty | RGB point-spread image of the filter: what one bright point looks like through it, centred, black outside the pattern. Covers any front-element PSF a preset wants - a dirty or smeared filter, a custom flare plate. Same asset type as the bokeh shape masks: an uncompressed 32-bit DDS next to the projector-light textures (e.g. `textures/lights/lens_flares/filter_star6.dds`; 4/6/8-point examples ship with the sample project, generator in the snapshot repo's `tools/`). Empty = procedural star. |
 
